STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT pax-extra.bdf -- PAX's own glyph rows beside Spleen 8x16 (gm01).
COMMENT Drawn by hand for PAX, cell for cell, in Spleen 8x16's metrics
COMMENT (8x16, ascent 12, descent 4) and its stroke weight (two-pixel
COMMENT dots), for the code points the wolf games' rich tiers use that
COMMENT Spleen 2.2.0 does not carry. Part of PAX: GPL-3.0 with the wolf
COMMENT Training Data Permission (LICENSE, LICENSE-TRAINING-DATA); not
COMMENT a part of Spleen. tools/mkfont merges these rows at build time.
FONT -pax-extra-medium-r-normal--16-160-72-72-C-80-ISO10646-1
SIZE 16 72 72
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 8 16 0 -4
STARTPROPERTIES 6
FAMILY_NAME "PAX extra"
PIXEL_SIZE 16
SPACING "C"
FONT_ASCENT 12
FONT_DESCENT 4
DEFAULT_CHAR 32
ENDPROPERTIES
CHARS 4
COMMENT ONE DOT LEADER: one two-pixel dot sitting on the baseline,
COMMENT centred in the cell (pack's and cub's path and gravel mark).
STARTCHAR uni2024
ENCODING 8228
SWIDTH 500 0
DWIDTH 8 0
BBX 8 16 0 -4
BITMAP
00
00
00
00
00
00
00
00
00
00
18
18
00
00
00
00
ENDCHAR
COMMENT BLACK SMALL SQUARE: a filled four-by-four square on the
COMMENT bullet's footprint, centred on the cell's middle (pack's shadow
COMMENT eye, trail's soil clod).
STARTCHAR uni25AA
ENCODING 9642
SWIDTH 500 0
DWIDTH 8 0
BBX 8 16 0 -4
